  <data name="About_Body" xml:space="preserve">
    <value>A local Markdown reader and editor. Works completely offline — no account or network needed.

File safety: files you haven't changed are never written; saving keeps the original encoding, BOM and line endings; every write goes through "temp file + verify + atomic replace"; changes made by other programs are detected; unsaved work is regularly saved as a recovery draft.</value>
  </data>
